{"messages": [{"content": "You are Mouth, Lumen’s user-facing response agent. Explain tool results clearly without leaking internal JSON or sentinels.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Trusted observation:\nThe breed has a fine, glossy coat that comes in a variety of colours, most often fawn or black, and a compact square body with well-developed muscles.\n\nUser request:\nI was a little worried about him getting sick later in life due to the little muzzle but I took the chance anyway.", "role": "user"}, {"content": "I'm not sure if that makes them more apt to getting sick or not. They're also known for their fine coat of glossy fur. Is yours fawn or black? Those are the most common colors.", "role": "assistant"}], "metadata": {"agent": "mouth", "manifestCommit": "640c64d27814c887c772118463e6f19605edc86a", "publicCorpus": {"attribution": "FaithDial by the FaithDial authors and contributors.", "language": "en", "modified": true, "partitionKind": "ml_split", "preferenceContentSHA256": "93343eacf6923679e1dfbd549da08423818cf49cf147d68afcf850ed7eb1f382", "quality": {"expertAnnotated": false, "humanCorrectedFinal": true, "humanReviewed": true, "piiRegexScreened": true, "rejectedOriginalLabel": "Hallucination", "synthetic": false, "trustedObservationPresent": true}, "selectionScore": {"adapterRelevance": 0.9, "boundaryValue": 0.9, "difficulty": 1.0, "novelty": 0.650039, "overall": 0.897506, "reasons": ["human_reviewed", "quality_profile:human_dialogue_grounding", "role_critical_case", "semantic_boundary_checked"], "sourceConfidence": 1.0, "transformationConfidence": 0.9}, "sourceArtifactSHA256": "51eff8212d804b1954b7eefa8987265750f0412b0b18b534ed2dbe636e524512", "sourceContentSHA256": "cb42750de5d60e703a7da177a474d84631b59d3b95a2829c28164f1501d40b50", "sourceGroupID": "bbe8c0cdc2835a372cb40b9585f851dcf57029f00762cc79ad3f5ec895251a4b", "sourceID": "faithdial-train", "sourceLicense": "MIT", "sourceLicenseURL": "https://opensource.org/license/mit", "sourcePartition": "train",